1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,660 --> 00:01:38,260
=Episode 14=

4
00:02:03,680 --> 00:02:05,150
(To my esteemed father:)

5
00:02:05,870 --> 00:02:07,000
(I came to the capital to study,)

6
00:02:07,870 --> 00:02:09,080
(hoping to make a name for myself.)

7
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:12,800
(But I met a wonderful woman,)

8
00:02:14,750 --> 00:02:15,840
(and we fell in love.)

9
00:02:18,750 --> 00:02:19,520
(I have no desire)

10
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:21,590
(to join noble clans.)

11
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:23,960
(A simple life with her)

12
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:25,710
(would be sweeter than honey.)

13
00:02:26,870 --> 00:02:28,080
(If I make the list one day,)

14
00:02:28,430 --> 00:02:30,190
(I'll do my best to bring honor)

15
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:31,520
(to our family.)

16
00:02:32,030 --> 00:02:34,430
(All I want is to marry
the woman I love.)

17
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:32,470
What's wrong?

18
00:03:32,870 --> 00:03:34,099
Don't... don't yell.

19
00:03:34,141 --> 00:03:35,451
I... I'm scared!

20
00:03:35,910 --> 00:03:36,560
Get out!

21
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:37,750
Get out!

22
00:03:37,870 --> 00:03:38,310
Get out!

23
00:03:38,430 --> 00:03:38,819
I'm leaving!

24
00:03:38,861 --> 00:03:39,301
Get out!

25
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:40,680
- Get out!
- I need my shoes!

26
00:03:41,310 --> 00:03:42,259
- Get out!
- I...

27
00:03:42,301 --> 00:03:43,021
- Get out!
- Fine, I'll go barefoot!

28
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:45,240
As if I forced you into this.

29
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:47,000
Let your family explain it to you.

30
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:48,400
Get out!

31
00:03:48,750 --> 00:03:49,430
I'm going!

32
00:03:49,590 --> 00:03:50,590
Get out!

33
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:15,190
Chunhua.

34
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:16,720
Chunhua, stop crying.

35
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:18,870
The Prince of Jin really likes you.

36
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:20,040
Chunhua,

37
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:21,630
I know you're upset.

38
00:04:22,070 --> 00:04:24,000
But this is a once-in-a-lifetime chance!

39
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:26,720
I just want you to marry well.

40
00:04:27,390 --> 00:04:28,190
To be blunt,

41
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:30,870
even if you want to be a maid,

42
00:04:31,070 --> 00:04:31,849
your brother can't spend

43
00:04:31,891 --> 00:04:33,651
his whole life hunting.

44
00:04:33,830 --> 00:04:34,809
Chunhua, listen to me...

45
00:04:34,851 --> 00:04:35,411
Get out!

46
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:36,830
Get out!

47
00:04:37,510 --> 00:04:39,169
- Get out!
- Chunhua, hear me out...

48
00:04:39,211 --> 00:04:40,381
Don't touch me!

49
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:41,289
Get out!

50
00:04:41,331 --> 00:04:42,029
Quick! Let's go, Mother!

51
00:04:42,071 --> 00:04:42,594
Get out!

52
00:04:42,636 --> 00:04:43,106
All right...

53
00:04:43,430 --> 00:04:44,630
Get out!

54
00:05:08,270 --> 00:05:08,750
Your Highness,

55
00:05:09,070 --> 00:05:10,830
I didn't expect her
to react so strongly.

56
00:05:11,680 --> 00:05:12,289
I'm sorry.

57
00:05:12,331 --> 00:05:12,771
Your Highness,

58
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:15,190
Chunhua will come around.

59
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:16,160
Yes, of course.

60
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:16,950
Please, calm down.

61
00:05:17,430 --> 00:05:18,190
Have some more to drink.

62
00:05:18,270 --> 00:05:18,750
Yes.

63
00:05:19,310 --> 00:05:19,720
Chunhua.

64
00:05:20,750 --> 00:05:21,160
Chunhua!

65
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:22,560
Chunhua!

66
00:05:23,310 --> 00:05:24,190
Where are you going?

67
00:05:24,750 --> 00:05:25,750
The Prince of Jin is still here!

68
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:29,560
What a mess!

69
00:05:49,490 --> 00:05:52,890
♪Why must this world know joy and pain?♪

70
00:05:53,220 --> 00:05:57,320
♪And break a heart that bears no blame?♪

71
00:05:57,860 --> 00:06:01,850
♪The moon wanes and waxes,
lovers part and reunite♪

72
00:06:01,900 --> 00:06:05,620
♪One moment too late,
love slips from sight♪

73
00:06:06,420 --> 00:06:09,060
♪I've tasted the ache
of wanting in vain♪

74
00:06:09,690 --> 00:06:14,020
♪Time lies sealed beneath clouds
heavy with rain♪

75
00:06:14,490 --> 00:06:18,490
♪As darkness engulfs the palace
and wildlands sway♪

76
00:06:18,540 --> 00:06:21,740
♪What can I do,
with no one to light the way?♪

77
00:06:22,430 --> 00:06:22,920
Chunhua!

78
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:26,190
Your Highness...

79
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:27,600
Save me...

80
00:06:27,830 --> 00:06:28,360
Chunhua!

81
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:31,920
I pushed them away and ran.

82
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:35,190
The whole way,

83
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:37,720
all I could do was run.

84
00:06:39,390 --> 00:06:41,240
My whole body felt numb.

85
00:06:42,870 --> 00:06:44,240
My legs didn't feel like my own.

86
00:06:45,310 --> 00:06:46,920
Neither did my arms.

87
00:06:48,190 --> 00:06:48,560
I...

88
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:53,600
Chunhua.

89
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:55,560
It's all right.

90
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:57,190
You're back.

91
00:06:58,510 --> 00:06:59,720
You're back with me now.

92
00:07:02,560 --> 00:07:03,240
It's all right.

93
00:07:03,720 --> 00:07:04,310
Your Highness,

94
00:07:05,870 --> 00:07:06,750
I don't understand.

95
00:07:08,600 --> 00:07:10,480
They're my family.

96
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:13,920
Why would they hurt me like that?

97
00:07:33,430 --> 00:07:33,950
Forget it.

98
00:07:36,720 --> 00:07:37,560
From now on,

99
00:07:39,310 --> 00:07:41,600
I'll consider my ties with them severed.

100
00:07:43,360 --> 00:07:44,480
That place

101
00:07:46,750 --> 00:07:48,600
is no longer my home.

102
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:51,630
My home is here.

103
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:55,430
I still have you, Your Highness.

104
00:07:56,360 --> 00:07:57,190
You still have me.

105
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:09,870
Then promise me.

106
00:08:10,480 --> 00:08:11,390
You won't do anything foolish.

107
00:08:13,390 --> 00:08:14,070
Don't grieve or hurt yourself

108
00:08:15,310 --> 00:08:16,920
over those people.

109
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:18,270
They're not worth it.

110
00:08:20,160 --> 00:08:20,830
Promise me.

111
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:27,830
For the next few days,

112
00:08:29,720 --> 00:08:30,800
you can sleep in my room.

113
00:08:31,600 --> 00:08:32,480
Get some proper rest.

114
00:08:34,030 --> 00:08:35,000
Don't worry about anything.

115
00:08:35,510 --> 00:08:36,270
I'll stay with you.

116
00:08:38,360 --> 00:08:39,200
And you'll stay with me.

117
00:08:40,600 --> 00:08:41,080
All right?

118
00:09:43,870 --> 00:09:44,270
Your Highness,

119
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:45,240
did you need me?

120
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:49,360
Your Highness,

121
00:09:50,480 --> 00:09:51,270
how is Chunhua?

122
00:09:52,240 --> 00:09:53,440
She only just fell asleep.

123
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:56,120
She cries even in her sleep.

124
00:10:02,840 --> 00:10:04,320
Take this letter to the Prince of Jin.

125
00:10:04,630 --> 00:10:05,480
Avoid the Princess Consort.

126
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:06,910
Make sure it reaches him himself.

127
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:08,550
Take this letter

128
00:10:09,270 --> 00:10:10,150
to Chunhua's family.

129
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:11,910
If they can't read,

130
00:10:12,510 --> 00:10:13,420
read it aloud to them.

131
00:10:13,420 --> 00:10:14,260
(Tomorrow, your daughter
will be married to the Prince of Jin.)

132
00:10:15,140 --> 00:10:15,780
Your Highness,

133
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:18,030
you're hosting a banquet
at Chunhua's home tomorrow

134
00:10:18,240 --> 00:10:19,120
and inviting the Prince of Jin

135
00:10:19,550 --> 00:10:20,510
to arrange the marriage yourself?

136
00:10:20,790 --> 00:10:21,080
Well...

137
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:21,960
Just deliver the letters.

138
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:25,510
Understood.

139
00:10:27,540 --> 00:10:32,380
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

140
00:11:20,060 --> 00:11:23,220
♪Why must this world know joy and pain?♪

141
00:11:23,560 --> 00:11:27,860
♪And break a heart that bears no blame?♪

142
00:11:28,260 --> 00:11:32,190
♪The moon wanes and waxes,
lovers part and reunite♪

143
00:11:32,240 --> 00:11:35,710
♪One moment too late,
love slips from sight♪

144
00:11:36,520 --> 00:11:39,690
♪I've tasted the ache
of wanting in vain♪

145
00:11:41,510 --> 00:11:42,720
Liu Wenji came by today.

146
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:46,550
He stood outside like a fool all day.

147
00:11:47,360 --> 00:11:48,630
He only left at curfew.

148
00:11:50,510 --> 00:11:51,670
If he comes again tomorrow,

149
00:11:53,750 --> 00:11:54,630
would you like to see him?

150
00:11:54,672 --> 00:11:58,642
♪Ask not why spring is so hard to leave♪

151
00:11:59,250 --> 00:12:02,650
♪One fleeting moment, forever captive♪

152
00:12:02,700 --> 00:12:04,580
♪Fate falls just short
of granting our plea♪

153
00:12:04,630 --> 00:12:05,360
I'm like this...

154
00:12:05,402 --> 00:12:07,322
♪Yet round we turn, to meet again♪

155
00:12:07,440 --> 00:12:08,240
How can I face him?

156
00:12:10,270 --> 00:12:10,840
Chunhua,

157
00:12:12,510 --> 00:12:13,270
listen to me.

158
00:12:14,550 --> 00:12:15,960
What happened wasn't your fault.

159
00:12:17,440 --> 00:12:19,440
Think of it as being bitten
by a mangy dog

160
00:12:19,750 --> 00:12:20,630
or getting splattered with mud.

161
00:12:22,360 --> 00:12:23,840
Didn't I wash it all off you?

162
00:12:23,950 --> 00:12:26,890
♪Though close at hand,
we're worlds apart♪

163
00:12:27,600 --> 00:12:28,550
My Chunhua

164
00:12:29,150 --> 00:12:30,550
is still as adorable as ever.

165
00:12:31,510 --> 00:12:32,270
Just as beautiful.

166
00:12:39,480 --> 00:12:40,120
But I...

167
00:12:42,030 --> 00:12:42,630
I've already...

168
00:12:42,790 --> 00:12:43,360
Chunhua.

169
00:12:44,720 --> 00:12:45,720
You're still the same person.

170
00:12:48,240 --> 00:12:49,670
Never turn against yourself.

171
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:52,080
And never punish yourself.

172
00:12:55,090 --> 00:12:59,060
♪The moon wanes and waxes,
lovers part and reunite♪

173
00:12:59,110 --> 00:13:02,580
♪One moment too late,
love slips from sight♪

174
00:13:03,690 --> 00:13:06,290
♪I've tasted the ache
of wanting in vain♪

175
00:13:07,090 --> 00:13:11,220
♪Time lies sealed beneath clouds
heavy with rain♪

176
00:13:11,720 --> 00:13:12,200
Your Highness...

177
00:13:12,242 --> 00:13:15,632
♪As darkness engulfs the palace
and wildlands sway♪

178
00:13:16,270 --> 00:13:17,790
I never understood before

179
00:13:19,670 --> 00:13:20,910
how much pain you were in.

180
00:13:23,870 --> 00:13:25,200
But now I do.

181
00:13:26,100 --> 00:13:28,690
♪One fleeting moment, forever captive♪

182
00:13:30,360 --> 00:13:31,510
It really hurts.

183
00:13:31,840 --> 00:13:34,110
♪Yet round we turn, to meet again♪

184
00:13:34,600 --> 00:13:37,490
♪The past dissolves like smoke♪

185
00:13:38,060 --> 00:13:42,290
♪Ask not why longing has no end♪

186
00:13:42,560 --> 00:13:45,490
♪I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

187
00:13:46,120 --> 00:13:48,340
♪May we lay sorrow down,
then sleep apart in peace♪

188
00:13:48,390 --> 00:13:50,800
♪Each guarding silence
through the years♪

189
00:13:50,850 --> 00:13:53,890
♪Though close at hand,
we're worlds apart♪

190
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:05,240
You're heading out this early?

191
00:14:05,440 --> 00:14:05,960
Come with me.

192
00:14:06,200 --> 00:14:06,840
I'll explain on the way.

193
00:14:17,270 --> 00:14:18,480
If Wenji finds out...

194
00:14:19,390 --> 00:14:20,240
Without Chunhua's agreement,

195
00:14:21,480 --> 00:14:23,550
not a word of this must reach Liu Wenji!

196
00:14:29,440 --> 00:14:30,600
Your Highness is bringing a blade.

197
00:14:31,030 --> 00:14:31,840
Is it to intimidate them,

198
00:14:32,510 --> 00:14:33,670
or do you intend to draw blood?

199
00:14:34,870 --> 00:14:35,750
The Prince of Jin deserves to die.

200
00:14:37,360 --> 00:14:38,320
Chunhua's family

201
00:14:39,030 --> 00:14:40,150
are worse than beasts.

202
00:14:41,870 --> 00:14:43,440
I won't let them get away.

203
00:14:46,630 --> 00:14:47,000
All right.

204
00:14:48,390 --> 00:14:49,480
Whatever you plan to do,

205
00:14:49,960 --> 00:14:51,080
I'll go with you.

206
00:14:51,790 --> 00:14:52,870
I know what you're worried about.

207
00:14:54,840 --> 00:14:55,360
Don't worry.

208
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:58,440
I'll spare that beast's life.

209
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:21,750
These refugees

210
00:15:22,960 --> 00:15:25,320
were likely driven from their homes

211
00:15:25,720 --> 00:15:26,600
by the Shence Army.

212
00:15:29,150 --> 00:15:30,480
Yu Cheng'an's hunting grounds

213
00:15:31,150 --> 00:15:33,000
may be far larger than we thought.

214
00:15:33,440 --> 00:15:34,840
Thousands of households are affected.

215
00:15:35,320 --> 00:15:36,910
His senior palace attendant, Zheng Xing,

216
00:15:37,630 --> 00:15:38,960
pledged to him

217
00:15:39,360 --> 00:15:42,000
to clear all farmland and homes
within three months.

218
00:15:42,600 --> 00:15:43,870
It's already cost many lives.

219
00:15:44,270 --> 00:15:46,080
Yu Cheng'an has always acted this way.

220
00:15:47,080 --> 00:15:48,670
He never cares who lives or dies.

221
00:15:51,600 --> 00:15:52,630
Even in peacetime,

222
00:15:53,080 --> 00:15:54,440
people can barely make ends meet.

223
00:15:55,150 --> 00:15:57,000
Now they're losing even their homes.

224
00:15:58,150 --> 00:15:59,390
If this continues,

225
00:16:00,270 --> 00:16:01,390
there'll be serious trouble.

226
00:16:19,480 --> 00:16:19,960
Your Highness,

227
00:16:20,270 --> 00:16:22,670
we have nothing better

228
00:16:23,270 --> 00:16:24,200
to offer.

229
00:16:24,440 --> 00:16:26,240
Please, make do with this tea.

230
00:16:27,750 --> 00:16:28,600
My sister-in-law

231
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:30,369
never brought back some decent tea

232
00:16:30,411 --> 00:16:31,931
from the Princess's place.

233
00:16:33,790 --> 00:16:34,720
Today,

234
00:16:35,150 --> 00:16:36,390
is Princess Danyang coming alone,

235
00:16:37,270 --> 00:16:39,320
or will Chunhua come too?

236
00:16:40,440 --> 00:16:41,150
Your Highness,

237
00:16:41,750 --> 00:16:43,750
the letter only said
the Princess would come.

238
00:16:44,320 --> 00:16:45,510
It didn't mention Chunhua.

239
00:16:46,790 --> 00:16:49,790
That girl is probably hiding
at the Princess's place,

240
00:16:50,480 --> 00:16:51,240
too shy to show her face.

241
00:16:52,550 --> 00:16:53,270
Exactly.

242
00:16:53,790 --> 00:16:55,360
She's been at the Princess's side,

243
00:16:55,630 --> 00:16:57,550
so she thinks she's nobility now.

244
00:16:57,630 --> 00:16:58,270
Putting on airs.

245
00:16:59,270 --> 00:16:59,600
Shut up!

246
00:17:03,030 --> 00:17:05,510
Your Highness, my... my wife means

247
00:17:05,720 --> 00:17:07,640
that with your favor,

248
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:10,440
Chunhua feels like
someone of high standing.

249
00:17:12,440 --> 00:17:12,830
Your Highness,

250
00:17:13,720 --> 00:17:15,529
when do you plan

251
00:17:15,571 --> 00:17:16,981
to bring Chunhua over?

252
00:17:22,110 --> 00:17:24,550
That depends on
whether she knows her place

253
00:17:24,920 --> 00:17:27,160
and knows how to please me.

254
00:17:28,240 --> 00:17:29,160
Wildflowers are lovely,

255
00:17:29,960 --> 00:17:32,200
but there's no shortage of them.

256
00:17:33,880 --> 00:17:34,400
Your Highness,

257
00:17:34,680 --> 00:17:36,270
our flower has always been

258
00:17:36,640 --> 00:17:39,510
so thoughtful and understanding.

259
00:17:39,680 --> 00:17:41,000
Exactly!

260
00:17:45,790 --> 00:17:46,830
That's enough.

261
00:17:47,750 --> 00:17:48,750
I can't stomach it.

262
00:17:49,830 --> 00:17:50,750
It's awful!

263
00:17:59,200 --> 00:17:59,480
Wan...

264
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:00,830
Wanyao, you're here.

265
00:18:01,880 --> 00:18:02,920
Is she Princess Danyang?

266
00:18:04,790 --> 00:18:05,480
Your Highness.

267
00:18:06,440 --> 00:18:06,769
Your Highness.

268
00:18:06,811 --> 00:18:07,371
Greetings.

269
00:18:09,240 --> 00:18:10,550
Now that everyone's here,

270
00:18:11,070 --> 00:18:11,790
wonderful.

271
00:18:19,790 --> 00:18:20,400
Don't bother looking.

272
00:18:20,720 --> 00:18:21,400
Chunhua isn't coming.

273
00:18:21,830 --> 00:18:23,070
She's cut ties

274
00:18:23,590 --> 00:18:24,640
with your entire family.

275
00:18:25,590 --> 00:18:27,720
I'm here to settle the score for her.

276
00:18:29,400 --> 00:18:31,769
We're family.
What score is there to settle?

277
00:18:31,811 --> 00:18:32,221
Yes.

278
00:18:32,920 --> 00:18:34,640
Please bring Chunhua here.

279
00:18:34,960 --> 00:18:36,720
We can explain everything to her.

280
00:18:41,350 --> 00:18:41,750
Son!

281
00:18:41,920 --> 00:18:42,769
Are you all right?

282
00:18:42,811 --> 00:18:43,079
I'm fine.

283
00:18:43,121 --> 00:18:43,384
Oh...

284
00:18:43,426 --> 00:18:43,946
I'm fine.

285
00:18:44,070 --> 00:18:46,000
I know you don't understand
what family means.

286
00:18:46,960 --> 00:18:48,270
Even the fiercest beast
won't harm its own young.

287
00:18:49,160 --> 00:18:51,030
As Chunhua's closest family,

288
00:18:51,400 --> 00:18:52,640
you sold her off once

289
00:18:53,200 --> 00:18:54,440
as a servant.

290
00:18:54,790 --> 00:18:55,920
And now you want to sell her again.

291
00:18:56,240 --> 00:18:56,880
Again and again.

292
00:18:58,160 --> 00:18:58,510
Stop right there!

293
00:19:04,070 --> 00:19:04,440
Wan...

294
00:19:04,550 --> 00:19:06,160
Wanyao, I truly love Chunhua.

295
00:19:06,510 --> 00:19:07,219
Look...

296
00:19:07,261 --> 00:19:08,709
What's done is done.

297
00:19:08,751 --> 00:19:10,781
I'm not one
to shirk my responsibilities.

298
00:19:11,240 --> 00:19:13,200
I've been meaning
to discuss this with you.

299
00:19:13,440 --> 00:19:14,979
But... you were busy.

300
00:19:15,021 --> 00:19:15,851
I didn't want to disturb you.

301
00:19:15,960 --> 00:19:17,179
But I...

302
00:19:17,221 --> 00:19:18,499
Even if I can't take her
into my residence,

303
00:19:18,541 --> 00:19:20,434
I can buy her a house elsewhere,

304
00:19:20,476 --> 00:19:22,586
and she can live comfortably.

305
00:19:27,480 --> 00:19:31,640
That hurts!

306
00:19:32,720 --> 00:19:33,680
Listen carefully.

307
00:19:34,550 --> 00:19:36,590
I have Chunhua's indenture.

308
00:19:37,160 --> 00:19:38,590
She's part of my household.

309
00:19:39,400 --> 00:19:40,480
Whether she marries or not,

310
00:19:40,680 --> 00:19:41,510
whether she stays or leaves,

311
00:19:41,830 --> 00:19:42,729
it's up to me.

312
00:19:42,771 --> 00:19:44,909
Yes... It's all up to you!

313
00:19:44,951 --> 00:19:46,104
I... I don't know

314
00:19:46,146 --> 00:19:47,306
why you're so angry.

315
00:19:47,440 --> 00:19:49,619
I thought she's just a maid...

316
00:19:49,661 --> 00:19:52,421
That hurts...

317
00:20:04,510 --> 00:20:05,640
Ti, you know

318
00:20:07,160 --> 00:20:08,590
ever since I returned from North Jing,

319
00:20:09,400 --> 00:20:10,440
I've become a madwoman.

320
00:20:11,270 --> 00:20:13,240
I can't stand the slightest provocation.

321
00:20:13,920 --> 00:20:14,960
I can't think straight.

322
00:20:15,400 --> 00:20:16,680
I just do whatever I feel like.

323
00:20:19,790 --> 00:20:20,310
What...

324
00:20:20,720 --> 00:20:21,640
What do you want to do?

325
00:20:21,920 --> 00:20:23,030
To be honest,

326
00:20:24,070 --> 00:20:27,160
I've been bottling up my anger.

327
00:20:27,400 --> 00:20:28,200
I couldn't take it anymore.

328
00:20:29,160 --> 00:20:30,350
I stabbed you today,

329
00:20:31,200 --> 00:20:31,960
and I feel much better.

330
00:20:32,350 --> 00:20:33,440
As long as you feel better...

331
00:20:34,030 --> 00:20:35,240
I hope you will

332
00:20:35,830 --> 00:20:37,110
keep your distance from Chunhua.

333
00:20:37,880 --> 00:20:39,240
If I catch you again,

334
00:20:41,270 --> 00:20:42,070
my sword

335
00:20:43,110 --> 00:20:44,510
won't miss.

336
00:20:52,640 --> 00:20:53,720
Ti, you've suffered.

337
00:20:55,920 --> 00:20:58,400
These commoners tried
to murder a prince.

338
00:20:59,000 --> 00:20:59,790
What punishment do they deserve?

339
00:21:07,960 --> 00:21:08,590
Come on.

340
00:21:09,590 --> 00:21:11,310
You're a prince.
You left without a scratch,

341
00:21:11,440 --> 00:21:12,440
then came back with a knife wound.

342
00:21:12,790 --> 00:21:14,160
Did you stab yourself?

343
00:21:18,160 --> 00:21:18,480
Yes!

344
00:21:19,720 --> 00:21:20,070
It's them!

345
00:21:20,590 --> 00:21:21,510
They stabbed me!

346
00:21:22,750 --> 00:21:23,240
I...

347
00:21:23,550 --> 00:21:24,750
Attempting to assassinate a prince

348
00:21:25,510 --> 00:21:26,510
means exile at best,

349
00:21:27,110 --> 00:21:28,070
execution at worst.

350
00:21:29,070 --> 00:21:30,000
Since you're the victim, Ti,

351
00:21:30,920 --> 00:21:32,000
you can press charges yourself.

352
00:21:33,680 --> 00:21:35,059
- We're innocent!
- I'll go!

353
00:21:35,101 --> 00:21:35,634
No!

354
00:21:35,676 --> 00:21:37,637
We're innocent!

355
00:21:37,679 --> 00:21:38,748
- We're innocent!
- We didn't kill anyone!

356
00:21:38,790 --> 00:21:39,239
I don't want to die!

357
00:21:39,281 --> 00:21:40,721
- Chunhua suffered far worse!
- I don't want to die!

358
00:21:44,350 --> 00:21:44,790
Wanyao...

359
00:21:45,790 --> 00:21:46,920
Can I leave now?

360
00:21:47,750 --> 00:21:48,920
I'm bleeding...

361
00:21:51,680 --> 00:21:52,459
You can't leave, Your Highness!

362
00:21:52,501 --> 00:21:53,389
Your Highness!

363
00:21:53,431 --> 00:21:53,861
Your Highness!

364
00:21:53,960 --> 00:21:55,331
- You can't leave, Your Highness!
- Don't go!

365
00:21:55,440 --> 00:21:57,499
- Your Highness, help us!
- What will we do without you?

366
00:21:57,541 --> 00:21:58,994
- Come back, Your Highness!
- Please save us!

367
00:21:59,036 --> 00:22:00,716
- Your Highness!
- Your Highness!

368
00:22:04,160 --> 00:22:04,640
(Come out at once!)

369
00:22:05,240 --> 00:22:05,750
(Hurry!)

370
00:22:06,200 --> 00:22:06,510
(Quick!)

371
00:22:07,680 --> 00:22:09,640
What's going on?

372
00:22:11,400 --> 00:22:12,030
The Shence Army?

373
00:22:13,000 --> 00:22:13,830
What are they doing here?

374
00:22:15,030 --> 00:22:15,510
Your Highness,

375
00:22:16,790 --> 00:22:17,400
the Shence Army's here.

376
00:22:23,160 --> 00:22:24,000
Has your land also been marked

377
00:22:24,240 --> 00:22:25,270
for the hunting grounds?

378
00:22:28,200 --> 00:22:28,720
Answer him!

379
00:22:29,240 --> 00:22:30,240
Y-Yes!

380
00:22:31,510 --> 00:22:33,030
Your Highness...

381
00:22:33,310 --> 00:22:34,699
That hurts!

382
00:22:34,741 --> 00:22:35,131
Your Highness,

383
00:22:35,350 --> 00:22:37,240
you must protect my family!

384
00:22:37,350 --> 00:22:37,640
I...

385
00:22:39,920 --> 00:22:40,680
Your Highness.

386
00:22:41,000 --> 00:22:42,750
Three months ago, an official said

387
00:22:42,830 --> 00:22:44,920
our entire village'd become
hunting grounds.

388
00:22:45,110 --> 00:22:46,899
My whole family entirely depends

389
00:22:46,941 --> 00:22:48,701
on this land and these mountains.

390
00:22:49,240 --> 00:22:51,030
We really have no other choice!

391
00:22:52,350 --> 00:22:52,790
Your Highness,

392
00:22:53,590 --> 00:22:55,550
now that you've slept with Chunhua,

393
00:22:56,000 --> 00:22:57,400
please, for Chunhua's sake,

394
00:22:57,550 --> 00:22:59,289
you... you must save our family!

395
00:22:59,331 --> 00:22:59,779
Your Highness!

396
00:22:59,821 --> 00:23:01,064
- Your Highness!
- Save us!

397
00:23:01,106 --> 00:23:02,276
- Please save us!
- That hurts!

398
00:23:02,640 --> 00:23:03,880
So this is why

399
00:23:04,240 --> 00:23:04,960
you sold Chunhua off?

400
00:23:06,310 --> 00:23:06,920
Your Highness...

401
00:23:07,110 --> 00:23:08,590
Your Highness,
tell them that's not true.

402
00:23:09,160 --> 00:23:10,070
Cut the crap!

403
00:23:10,550 --> 00:23:11,510
What's wrong with you?

404
00:23:12,110 --> 00:23:13,310
I'm bleeding!

405
00:23:13,590 --> 00:23:14,880
Use your heads!

406
00:23:15,590 --> 00:23:16,790
Who... who would dare stop

407
00:23:17,160 --> 00:23:18,000
the man building hunting grounds?

408
00:23:19,000 --> 00:23:20,270
Just wait until you're exiled!

409
00:23:21,160 --> 00:23:22,070
I'm leaving.

410
00:23:22,440 --> 00:23:23,489
Wanyao, I'm off.

411
00:23:23,531 --> 00:23:25,021
- I'm going home for dinner...
- Your Highness!

412
00:23:25,110 --> 00:23:25,809
Your Highness, hear me out!

413
00:23:25,851 --> 00:23:27,421
You can't leave, Your Highness...

414
00:23:30,440 --> 00:23:30,920
Your Highness!

415
00:23:31,160 --> 00:23:32,769
Your Highness,
you care for Chunhua the most.

416
00:23:32,811 --> 00:23:34,091
Please, save our family!

417
00:23:34,270 --> 00:23:35,830
Your Highness!

418
00:23:42,070 --> 00:23:44,830
Search every inch of this place.

419
00:23:45,110 --> 00:23:46,249
Leave no one behind.

420
00:23:46,291 --> 00:23:47,131
Tie them all up!

421
00:23:47,640 --> 00:23:48,440
Line them up!

422
00:23:49,960 --> 00:23:50,400
Sir,

423
00:23:51,270 --> 00:23:52,640
looks like he's running away!

424
00:23:54,880 --> 00:23:57,000
It's been ages
since I stretched my arms.

425
00:24:04,640 --> 00:24:05,400
Go check on him.

426
00:24:05,510 --> 00:24:05,859
Yes, sir!

427
00:24:05,901 --> 00:24:07,851
Let's see who dares pull this stunt.

428
00:24:12,200 --> 00:24:12,640
Run!

429
00:24:13,030 --> 00:24:13,750
Where are you running to?

430
00:24:14,750 --> 00:24:15,920
What scoundrel are you?

431
00:24:16,590 --> 00:24:18,030
How dare you shoot me!

432
00:24:18,480 --> 00:24:19,830
I'm the Prince of Jin!

433
00:24:21,550 --> 00:24:22,750
Oh, you're the Prince of Jin?

434
00:24:29,200 --> 00:24:29,960
Reporting.

435
00:24:30,680 --> 00:24:32,200
That man claims he's

436
00:24:32,790 --> 00:24:33,240
Prince of Jin.

437
00:24:41,680 --> 00:24:43,000
Everyone thinks they can bully me!

438
00:24:43,790 --> 00:24:44,158
(Oh, no!)

439
00:24:44,200 --> 00:24:45,110
Even a eunuch dares bully me!

440
00:24:45,152 --> 00:24:46,072
(He really is the Prince of Jin!)

441
00:24:46,590 --> 00:24:48,068
(What is he doing here?)

442
00:24:48,110 --> 00:24:50,680
I'll make the Emperor give me justice!

443
00:24:50,920 --> 00:24:51,400
Sir,

444
00:24:52,440 --> 00:24:54,270
could he really be the Prince of Jin?

445
00:24:54,680 --> 00:24:56,270
Today's just not my day.

446
00:24:57,590 --> 00:24:59,400
If he makes a fuss about this,

447
00:24:59,960 --> 00:25:01,510
and my godfather finds out,

448
00:25:02,350 --> 00:25:04,110
he'll never let me off easy.

449
00:25:04,510 --> 00:25:07,920
My whole future will be ruined.

450
00:25:10,880 --> 00:25:12,640
I say, since we're
in the middle of nowhere,

451
00:25:12,750 --> 00:25:13,240
we should...

452
00:25:21,550 --> 00:25:23,590
Burn his body too.

453
00:25:23,750 --> 00:25:25,030
Leave no trace behind.

454
00:25:25,350 --> 00:25:25,680
Got it.

455
00:25:26,590 --> 00:25:26,920
Move!

456
00:25:33,070 --> 00:25:35,110
Are you taking me back to the palace?

457
00:25:35,270 --> 00:25:37,350
I... I can walk on my own!

458
00:25:38,270 --> 00:25:39,200
Mr. Zheng,

459
00:25:39,680 --> 00:25:41,489
please, have mercy!

460
00:25:41,531 --> 00:25:41,901
Sir,

461
00:25:42,440 --> 00:25:44,030
there are homes all around us.

462
00:25:44,310 --> 00:25:45,550
Someone might see it.

463
00:25:49,680 --> 00:25:50,920
Let's kill

464
00:25:51,270 --> 00:25:52,680
every last witness.

465
00:25:53,350 --> 00:25:53,640
Got it.

466
00:25:54,680 --> 00:25:54,960
Move!

467
00:25:58,110 --> 00:25:59,720
They're determined to silence everyone.

468
00:26:00,400 --> 00:26:00,790
Your Highness,

469
00:26:01,400 --> 00:26:02,440
I'll get you and Mr. Yan out of here.

470
00:26:03,240 --> 00:26:05,000
With this many troops,
I doubt we can make it.

471
00:26:05,720 --> 00:26:06,160
Fang Tong,

472
00:26:07,310 --> 00:26:08,550
however mighty you are,

473
00:26:09,000 --> 00:26:10,270
you can't beat this many soldiers.

474
00:26:11,750 --> 00:26:12,400
If we fight our way out,

475
00:26:13,000 --> 00:26:14,110
all three of us will die here.

476
00:26:14,720 --> 00:26:15,350
Then what do we do?

477
00:26:16,160 --> 00:26:17,200
I shouldn't have agreed

478
00:26:17,720 --> 00:26:18,400
to bring you here.

479
00:26:18,640 --> 00:26:19,920
Now's no time for that!

480
00:26:21,550 --> 00:26:22,070
Right now,

481
00:26:23,310 --> 00:26:24,440
there may be only one way.

482
00:26:27,270 --> 00:26:27,680
Yan Shang,

483
00:26:30,000 --> 00:26:30,590
do you remember

484
00:26:31,440 --> 00:26:32,680
that embroidered picture of five fish?

485
00:26:34,030 --> 00:26:34,590
Today,

486
00:26:35,030 --> 00:26:36,030
I'll make the first move.

487
00:26:42,160 --> 00:26:42,720
(Zheng Xing,)

488
00:26:43,590 --> 00:26:44,638
(for the sake
of these people's lives...)

489
00:26:44,680 --> 00:26:45,880
Thoroughly search the place again!

490
00:26:45,922 --> 00:26:47,548
(You must die today!)

491
00:26:47,590 --> 00:26:48,880
Leave no survivors!

492
00:26:54,240 --> 00:26:54,720
Sir!

493
00:26:56,640 --> 00:26:57,070
(Watch out!)

494
00:26:57,350 --> 00:26:57,880
(Stay alert!)

495
00:26:59,480 --> 00:26:59,735
(Sir?)

496
00:26:59,800 --> 00:27:00,220
(Sir?)

497
00:27:00,270 --> 00:27:00,529
Sir?

498
00:27:00,571 --> 00:27:00,941
Sir...

499
00:27:03,240 --> 00:27:04,030
(Don't panic, everyone!)

500
00:27:04,880 --> 00:27:05,350
They're inside the house.

501
00:27:06,200 --> 00:27:06,960
The criminal's in there!

502
00:27:07,240 --> 00:27:08,110
Seize them!

503
00:27:08,270 --> 00:27:08,590
Quick!

504
00:27:10,000 --> 00:27:10,400
Hurry!

505
00:27:13,240 --> 00:27:13,590
(Follow me!)

506
00:27:15,350 --> 00:27:15,920
(Over here!)

507
00:27:22,920 --> 00:27:23,880
(Who's in there?)

508
00:27:24,030 --> 00:27:24,510
(Come out!)

509
00:27:37,350 --> 00:27:38,070
You shot that arrow?

510
00:27:39,240 --> 00:27:39,550
Yes.

511
00:27:40,030 --> 00:27:40,510
It was me.

512
00:27:41,790 --> 00:27:42,240
Yan Shang!

513
00:27:46,960 --> 00:27:48,400
Zheng Xing was ruthless,

514
00:27:48,960 --> 00:27:49,790
preyed on the people.

515
00:27:50,200 --> 00:27:51,160
Killing him today

516
00:27:51,880 --> 00:27:53,070
was justice in Heaven's name.

517
00:27:54,480 --> 00:27:55,070
Very well!

518
00:27:55,790 --> 00:27:56,550
You all heard that?

519
00:27:57,400 --> 00:27:58,640
Seize this criminal!

520
00:27:58,790 --> 00:27:59,920
Avenge Mr. Zheng!

521
00:28:00,200 --> 00:28:00,510
Move!

522
00:28:00,790 --> 00:28:01,590
(Yes, sir!)

523
00:28:01,720 --> 00:28:02,680
I am Princess Danyang!

524
00:28:03,160 --> 00:28:03,920
Who dares to act recklessly?

525
00:28:08,640 --> 00:28:09,480
Zheng Xing is dead.

526
00:28:09,830 --> 00:28:11,200
If you dare lay a hand on me,

527
00:28:11,880 --> 00:28:12,960
do you want to join him in the grave?

528
00:28:16,110 --> 00:28:17,750
Today, I'll see for myself

529
00:28:18,480 --> 00:28:19,880
who dares to harm

530
00:28:21,400 --> 00:28:22,550
a member of the imperial family

531
00:28:23,200 --> 00:28:24,720
and risk having
their entire clan wiped out!

532
00:28:29,200 --> 00:28:29,920
You few,

533
00:28:30,350 --> 00:28:31,510
what rank do you hold?

534
00:28:33,270 --> 00:28:34,270
Raising your weapons against me,

535
00:28:34,720 --> 00:28:35,920
are you attempting to assassinate me?

536
00:28:40,160 --> 00:28:42,400
We failed to recognize Your Highness.

537
00:28:42,790 --> 00:28:43,920
Please forgive us.

538
00:28:47,440 --> 00:28:48,160
However,

539
00:28:49,510 --> 00:28:52,030
this criminal has confessed
to killing Mr. Zheng.

540
00:28:52,960 --> 00:28:54,000
Princess Danyang,

541
00:28:54,480 --> 00:28:55,550
are you trying to shield him?

542
00:29:00,880 --> 00:29:01,350
Your Highness,

543
00:29:02,110 --> 00:29:04,200
I must be the one who killed Zheng Xing.

544
00:29:05,270 --> 00:29:06,160
I can't save you,

545
00:29:06,590 --> 00:29:07,680
but you can save me.

546
00:29:09,030 --> 00:29:09,550
So,

547
00:29:10,590 --> 00:29:11,550
you must stay out of it.

548
00:29:13,070 --> 00:29:14,200
Remember, patience.

549
00:29:15,000 --> 00:29:15,750
That python

550
00:29:16,550 --> 00:29:17,680
has yet to bare its fangs.

551
00:29:24,160 --> 00:29:25,200
Then I'll ask Your Highness

552
00:29:26,070 --> 00:29:26,920
to see me off a little farther.

553
00:29:36,270 --> 00:29:37,000
Officers,

554
00:29:37,920 --> 00:29:38,440
I hereby

555
00:29:38,960 --> 00:29:39,680
turn myself in.

556
00:29:41,110 --> 00:29:41,640
I ask you all

557
00:29:42,310 --> 00:29:43,070
to escort me back

558
00:29:43,640 --> 00:29:44,750
to stand trial.

559
00:29:45,480 --> 00:29:45,830
Take him away!

560
00:29:46,550 --> 00:29:46,960
Yes, sir!

561
00:29:47,110 --> 00:29:47,590
How dare you!

562
00:29:49,160 --> 00:29:50,240
I'll escort him myself.

563
00:29:52,550 --> 00:29:53,480
How dare you lay a hand on him?

564
00:30:14,440 --> 00:30:15,720
Let it be known to all:

565
00:30:16,400 --> 00:30:17,480
I, Yan Shang,

566
00:30:18,160 --> 00:30:19,550
killed Zheng Xing today.

567
00:30:20,070 --> 00:30:22,270
Princess Danyang herself is escorting me

568
00:30:23,110 --> 00:30:24,240
back to the city to surrender!

569
00:30:28,030 --> 00:30:33,070
(Thank you, hero!)

570
00:30:33,480 --> 00:30:33,960
(Thank you!)

571
00:30:34,240 --> 00:30:35,070
I, Yan Shang,

572
00:30:35,590 --> 00:30:37,070
killed Zheng Xing today.

573
00:30:37,750 --> 00:30:40,000
Princess Danyang herself is escorting me

574
00:30:40,480 --> 00:30:41,550
back to the city to surrender!

575
00:30:42,590 --> 00:30:43,590
I, Yan Shang,

576
00:30:44,070 --> 00:30:45,440
killed Zheng Xing today.

577
00:30:46,110 --> 00:30:48,270
Princess Danyang herself is escorting me

578
00:30:48,920 --> 00:30:49,960
back to the city to surrender!

579
00:30:51,020 --> 00:30:55,620
♪I gaze at high peaks
and sails far away♪

580
00:30:56,120 --> 00:30:59,320
♪With the world in my heart,
I leave the shore♪

581
00:31:00,290 --> 00:31:05,320
♪Dusk falls on the horizon,
sorrow and joy stretch far♪

582
00:31:05,690 --> 00:31:08,920
♪A lone lamp keeps me company♪

583
00:31:10,260 --> 00:31:14,890
♪By noon, the mist will lift;
rivers will bend♪

584
00:31:16,060 --> 00:31:18,420
(Well done!)

585
00:31:18,590 --> 00:31:24,719
(Well done!)

586
00:31:24,760 --> 00:31:26,615
(You're our benefactor!)

587
00:31:27,820 --> 00:31:30,315
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

588
00:31:30,357 --> 00:31:32,597
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

589
00:31:32,790 --> 00:31:35,310
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

590
00:31:35,510 --> 00:31:38,310
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

591
00:31:38,590 --> 00:31:44,422
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

592
00:31:44,422 --> 00:31:48,310
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

593
00:31:48,310 --> 00:31:52,198
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

594
00:31:52,198 --> 00:31:58,030
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

595
00:31:58,550 --> 00:32:01,480
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

596
00:32:01,590 --> 00:32:04,750
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

597
00:32:05,310 --> 00:32:08,000
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

598
00:32:08,760 --> 00:32:11,240
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

599
00:32:13,092 --> 00:32:17,210
♪With the world in my heart,
I leave the shore♪

600
00:32:17,252 --> 00:32:22,282
♪Frost on my shoulders,
joys and sorrows stretch afar♪

601
00:32:22,570 --> 00:32:25,800
♪A thousand miles of lights
keep me company♪

602
00:32:27,140 --> 00:32:31,770
♪By noon, the mist will lift;
rivers will bend♪

603
00:32:32,170 --> 00:32:35,300
♪Today, lean on the rail with me again♪

604
00:32:40,700 --> 00:32:41,540
(By Lord Yu's order,)

605
00:32:42,030 --> 00:32:43,060
(as this case concerns
the hunting grounds,)

606
00:32:43,660 --> 00:32:45,900
(the murder suspect must not
be taken to the Capital Prefecture!)

607
00:32:46,540 --> 00:32:48,790
(The Yintaimen Investigation Office
will handle the case.)

608
00:32:49,440 --> 00:32:49,880
(Take him away!)

609
00:32:50,400 --> 00:32:50,790
(Yes, sir!)

610
00:33:25,270 --> 00:33:27,160
I should've checked my luck.

611
00:33:27,240 --> 00:33:28,310
It hurts like hell...

612
00:33:33,240 --> 00:33:34,550
Wh-why are you coming to me again?

613
00:33:35,070 --> 00:33:36,720
You nearly died
at Zheng Xing's hands today.

614
00:33:37,200 --> 00:33:38,350
Do you know how you survived?

615
00:33:39,790 --> 00:33:42,110
Wanyao, I... passed out from the pain.

616
00:33:42,480 --> 00:33:43,550
I have no idea.

617
00:33:44,030 --> 00:33:46,750
Yan Shang, the Third-Place Scholar,
shot Zheng Xing.

618
00:33:46,920 --> 00:33:47,590
He saved your life.

619
00:33:48,640 --> 00:33:49,160
Now,

620
00:33:49,550 --> 00:33:51,110
he's been sent to
the Yintaimen Investigation Office.

621
00:33:53,440 --> 00:33:54,070
The Investigation Office?

622
00:33:55,640 --> 00:33:57,350
That's no place for a human being.

623
00:33:58,160 --> 00:33:59,550
No one comes out of there unscathed.

624
00:34:00,310 --> 00:34:00,790
Ti,

625
00:34:01,400 --> 00:34:02,640
you must testify in his defense.

626
00:34:03,590 --> 00:34:05,590
Today, Zheng Xing tried to silence you.

627
00:34:05,960 --> 00:34:06,880
Yan Shang was saving you.

628
00:34:09,110 --> 00:34:09,550
No!

629
00:34:10,150 --> 00:34:10,760
My leg...

630
00:34:11,590 --> 00:34:12,710
was hurt by that family.

631
00:34:14,630 --> 00:34:16,000
Zheng Xing had nothing to do with it.

632
00:34:16,760 --> 00:34:17,150
Tomorrow,

633
00:34:17,880 --> 00:34:19,110
I'll have the authorities arrest them

634
00:34:19,510 --> 00:34:20,280
and exile them all!

635
00:34:23,000 --> 00:34:23,480
Wanyao,

636
00:34:24,400 --> 00:34:26,630
if Lord Yu finds out,
there'll be hell to pay.

637
00:34:27,320 --> 00:34:28,800
I advise you to stay out of it, too.

638
00:34:29,590 --> 00:34:31,510
You think Yintaimen care
about right and wrong?

639
00:34:32,360 --> 00:34:33,440
Maybe Yan Shang just wants

640
00:34:33,550 --> 00:34:34,800
to die for a noble cause

641
00:34:35,190 --> 00:34:36,190
and make a name for himself.

642
00:34:40,320 --> 00:34:41,150
You're right.

643
00:34:44,110 --> 00:34:44,710
Your injury

644
00:34:45,440 --> 00:34:46,590
was caused by that family.

645
00:34:49,320 --> 00:34:50,440
Your wife has always been jealous.

646
00:34:51,190 --> 00:34:52,000
If she finds out

647
00:34:52,880 --> 00:34:53,840
you left the city in disguise

648
00:34:54,070 --> 00:34:55,190
just to chase after a woman...

649
00:34:56,190 --> 00:34:56,760
Wanyao,

650
00:34:57,440 --> 00:34:58,590
my dear sister,

651
00:35:00,710 --> 00:35:01,360
since you won't

652
00:35:02,030 --> 00:35:03,110
let me have Chunhua,

653
00:35:03,510 --> 00:35:05,150
this stays between us.

654
00:35:05,510 --> 00:35:07,190
Don't let my wife find out, all right?

655
00:35:07,590 --> 00:35:08,630
If you refuse to testify,

656
00:35:09,000 --> 00:35:10,030
she will definitely find out!

657
00:35:10,550 --> 00:35:10,840
You...

658
00:35:15,280 --> 00:35:16,070
You little brat!

659
00:35:16,920 --> 00:35:18,480
You're truly vicious!

660
00:35:19,030 --> 00:35:20,400
Go tell her, then!

661
00:35:21,110 --> 00:35:22,440
Even if she claws my face off

662
00:35:23,280 --> 00:35:24,400
and tears my hair out,

663
00:35:25,440 --> 00:35:26,710
I still won't testify!

664
00:35:28,440 --> 00:35:30,800
He killed Lord Yu's trusted aide!

665
00:35:34,670 --> 00:35:37,630
That hurts!

666
00:35:39,000 --> 00:35:41,030
Wanyao, I know you're upset.

667
00:35:42,070 --> 00:35:43,440
Go tell her, then!

668
00:35:44,960 --> 00:35:45,590
Hit me if you want!

669
00:35:46,630 --> 00:35:48,840
It's still better than crossing Lord Yu.

670
00:35:49,630 --> 00:35:50,280
Crossing him

671
00:35:51,030 --> 00:35:52,280
is as good as death!

672
00:35:53,000 --> 00:35:53,400
Go on, hit me!

673
00:36:03,760 --> 00:36:04,920
It hurts like hell...

674
00:36:13,620 --> 00:36:14,049
(Virtue Shines)

675
00:36:14,091 --> 00:36:16,211
(Yan Shang's been in the Yintaimen
for two hours.)

676
00:36:19,590 --> 00:36:20,150
(Now,)

677
00:36:21,280 --> 00:36:23,030
(if there's any chance of saving him,)

678
00:36:24,440 --> 00:36:25,590
(only Father can help.)

679
00:36:26,360 --> 00:36:26,840
(Your Highness.)

680
00:36:27,440 --> 00:36:28,590
(Remember, patience.)

681
00:36:29,510 --> 00:36:30,190
(That python)

682
00:36:31,030 --> 00:36:32,150
(has yet to bare its fangs.)

683
00:36:34,280 --> 00:36:36,070
(If I were trapped
in that python's jaws,)

684
00:36:36,840 --> 00:36:37,590
(I could endure it.)

685
00:36:38,510 --> 00:36:39,190
(But Yan Shang...)

686
00:36:39,960 --> 00:36:41,510
(Now you're the one)

687
00:36:42,030 --> 00:36:42,840
(caught in its jaws.)

688
00:36:48,760 --> 00:36:50,259
Since I ascended the throne,

689
00:36:50,301 --> 00:36:52,821
I've pardoned only three people.

690
00:36:53,590 --> 00:36:56,960
And all three had achieved
extraordinary feats.

691
00:36:58,320 --> 00:37:00,150
What has Yan Shang done?

692
00:37:00,920 --> 00:37:01,710
He killed Zheng Xing,

693
00:37:02,400 --> 00:37:03,710
saving countless lives.

694
00:37:04,230 --> 00:37:04,960
It was a righteous deed.

695
00:37:08,510 --> 00:37:10,280
The sages punish the wicked,

696
00:37:11,280 --> 00:37:12,230
save lives and restore order,

697
00:37:12,670 --> 00:37:13,840
and must resort to punishment

698
00:37:14,400 --> 00:37:15,510
to bring peace to the realm.

699
00:37:16,230 --> 00:37:17,320
Yan Shang may not be a sage,

700
00:37:18,440 --> 00:37:19,440
but he's a good man.

701
00:37:21,840 --> 00:37:23,440
There are plenty of good men.

702
00:37:25,360 --> 00:37:25,710
Wanyao,

703
00:37:26,440 --> 00:37:27,590
tell me the truth.

704
00:37:28,440 --> 00:37:31,320
Why make an exception for this man?

705
00:37:35,550 --> 00:37:36,190
You must understand,

706
00:37:36,630 --> 00:37:38,030
once I issue this pardon,

707
00:37:38,800 --> 00:37:39,630
Yu Cheng'an will come here

708
00:37:40,360 --> 00:37:41,230
in no time

709
00:37:42,710 --> 00:37:45,230
and demand an explanation.

710
00:37:46,550 --> 00:37:47,230
Don't kneel.

711
00:37:49,070 --> 00:37:49,630
I understand.

712
00:37:51,320 --> 00:37:52,480
I've let you down.

713
00:37:52,820 --> 00:37:56,100
(Universe in Harmony)

714
00:37:56,190 --> 00:37:56,710
Rise.

715
00:38:01,070 --> 00:38:03,360
Now tell me why.

716
00:38:04,440 --> 00:38:07,360
Even if I issue a hundred pardons

717
00:38:07,440 --> 00:38:08,590
to help you,

718
00:38:09,480 --> 00:38:11,630
Yu Cheng'an wouldn't dare kill me.

719
00:38:13,480 --> 00:38:14,280
All these years,

720
00:38:15,800 --> 00:38:17,440
I've endured his oppression.

721
00:38:17,880 --> 00:38:19,000
So this is no big deal.

722
00:38:20,320 --> 00:38:23,030
I need to know why.

723
00:38:24,630 --> 00:38:26,070
What makes him so special?

724
00:38:27,480 --> 00:38:28,190
So special that,

725
00:38:29,630 --> 00:38:30,819
even knowing the consequences,

726
00:38:30,861 --> 00:38:33,091
you'd still beg me to save him?

727
00:38:36,920 --> 00:38:38,000
He's taking the blame for me.

728
00:38:39,760 --> 00:38:40,880
I killed Zheng Xing.

729
00:38:45,360 --> 00:38:46,550
I see.

730
00:38:50,360 --> 00:38:51,590
His actions make sense.

731
00:38:52,550 --> 00:38:54,070
No wonder you'd risk everything

732
00:38:54,920 --> 00:38:55,960
to clear his name.

733
00:38:57,480 --> 00:38:58,400
Please spare him, Father.

734
00:39:01,360 --> 00:39:01,960
Get up.

735
00:39:06,000 --> 00:39:08,320
Did he take the blame for you willingly?

736
00:39:08,880 --> 00:39:09,280
Yes.

737
00:39:11,110 --> 00:39:11,960
That explains it.

738
00:39:13,030 --> 00:39:14,440
His actions are understandable,

739
00:39:14,630 --> 00:39:15,400
but that doesn't mean

740
00:39:15,880 --> 00:39:17,070
his plight deserves sympathy.

741
00:39:17,360 --> 00:39:17,960
Father!

742
00:39:20,150 --> 00:39:20,800
Wanyao,

743
00:39:21,550 --> 00:39:22,840
you're so determined to protect him.

744
00:39:26,760 --> 00:39:28,510
Is it guilt,

745
00:39:29,440 --> 00:39:30,760
or do you have feelings for him?

746
00:39:32,670 --> 00:39:33,550
I feel guilty.

747
00:39:35,590 --> 00:39:36,550
I've let you down.

748
00:39:40,590 --> 00:39:43,030
If he's the man you love,

749
00:39:43,510 --> 00:39:44,960
I'll issue the pardon right now.

750
00:39:46,320 --> 00:39:48,070
But if he's merely your benefactor,

751
00:39:49,280 --> 00:39:51,230
I'll see that he gets a proper burial.

752
00:39:57,550 --> 00:39:58,510
Gratitude or love,

753
00:39:59,880 --> 00:40:00,760
how can I tell them apart?

754
00:40:03,920 --> 00:40:04,440
Father,

755
00:40:07,400 --> 00:40:08,760
Yan Shang has the talent
to save our state.

756
00:40:10,150 --> 00:40:11,190
Why not spare his life

757
00:40:11,960 --> 00:40:13,030
so he will advise the court

758
00:40:13,480 --> 00:40:14,360
and serve our realm?

759
00:40:42,360 --> 00:40:45,360
(The circumstances invite leniency.
Let leniency be shown.)

760
00:41:07,080 --> 00:41:09,660
(Grant him special pardon. Proclaim it
far and wide, that all may know.)

761
00:41:11,510 --> 00:41:12,190
Thank you, Father!

762
00:41:13,070 --> 00:41:13,710
Rise.

763
00:41:21,710 --> 00:41:22,760
Go save him.

764
00:41:24,460 --> 00:41:27,900
(Universe in Harmony)

765
00:41:33,590 --> 00:41:36,280
Why didn't you tell Princess Danyang

766
00:41:37,230 --> 00:41:39,030
that the people you tried to save

767
00:41:39,480 --> 00:41:40,590
with your past three pardons

768
00:41:41,230 --> 00:41:44,400
all ended up unsaved?

769
00:41:47,670 --> 00:41:49,800
If Yu Cheng'an sees this pardon,

770
00:41:50,710 --> 00:41:53,150
Yan Shang is as good as dead.

771
00:41:56,630 --> 00:41:58,230
Since you think so highly of him,

772
00:41:59,400 --> 00:42:01,190
why not help him yourself?

773
00:42:02,000 --> 00:42:05,230
My pardon could be a death warrant.

774
00:42:05,670 --> 00:42:06,630
But you're different.

775
00:42:07,030 --> 00:42:08,070
Yu Cheng'an will

776
00:42:08,190 --> 00:42:11,280
still show you some respect.

777
00:42:12,440 --> 00:42:12,960
I'm not saving him.

778
00:42:15,150 --> 00:42:16,320
In Go,

779
00:42:17,400 --> 00:42:18,280
you first open a ko,

780
00:42:18,800 --> 00:42:19,590
then fight it,

781
00:42:20,360 --> 00:42:22,000
find a ko threat and answer it,

782
00:42:22,230 --> 00:42:23,150
then fight again.

783
00:42:24,070 --> 00:42:24,760
We've only

784
00:42:25,480 --> 00:42:26,800
just begun the ko fight.

785
00:42:27,920 --> 00:42:29,150
It's far too soon

786
00:42:29,800 --> 00:42:30,760
to settle it.

787
00:42:32,190 --> 00:42:34,110
If it dies now,

788
00:42:35,320 --> 00:42:37,590
it'll just be a useless stone.

789
00:42:38,550 --> 00:42:40,880
(Serene and Content)
Young men lack foresight

790
00:42:42,000 --> 00:42:42,960
and lose their cool.

791
00:42:44,150 --> 00:42:45,630
They've already put themselves

792
00:42:47,030 --> 00:42:49,190
in a dead position.

793
00:42:55,480 --> 00:42:56,800
So how would you

794
00:42:57,510 --> 00:42:58,760
break out of it?

795
00:42:59,920 --> 00:43:01,280
The river of love is hard to cross.

796
00:43:02,590 --> 00:43:03,840
You must cross it yourself.

797
00:43:06,280 --> 00:43:07,089
A dead end...

798
00:43:07,131 --> 00:43:08,651
A dead end is hard to escape.

799
00:43:10,110 --> 00:43:11,190
Only you can save yourself.

800
00:43:32,230 --> 00:43:33,230
You've got a tough backbone.

801
00:43:34,440 --> 00:43:37,000
You actually survived
a full day of whipping.

802
00:43:41,880 --> 00:43:44,320
Who ordered you to kill Mr. Zheng?

803
00:43:45,070 --> 00:43:45,550
Speak!

804
00:43:56,760 --> 00:43:59,510
Was it the Crown Prince?

805
00:44:15,320 --> 00:44:16,320
I want to see...

806
00:44:17,510 --> 00:44:18,360
Lord Yu.

807
00:44:18,760 --> 00:44:21,400
You can just demand to see Lord Yu, huh?

808
00:44:23,280 --> 00:44:24,819
I'd advise you to talk now

809
00:44:24,861 --> 00:44:25,861
and spare yourself some pain.

810
00:44:26,590 --> 00:44:28,920
You might even keep your body intact.

811
00:44:30,590 --> 00:44:32,510
I have a secret to report to Lord Yu.

812
00:44:38,320 --> 00:44:39,510
If you delay something important,

813
00:44:41,190 --> 00:44:42,670
can you bear the consequences?

814
00:44:44,110 --> 00:44:45,800
If this weren't top secret,

815
00:44:46,960 --> 00:44:47,920
why would Princess Danyang

816
00:44:48,840 --> 00:44:50,670
go to such lengths to protect me?

817
00:44:52,630 --> 00:44:55,030
I must see Lord Yu at once.

818
00:44:56,920 --> 00:44:58,550
If you dare deceive me...

819
00:44:59,230 --> 00:45:00,760
(Lord Yu has arrived!)

820
00:45:15,340 --> 00:45:19,940
(Next Episode Preview)

821
00:45:26,800 --> 00:45:28,800
Imperial Physician Huang,
what's happening?

822
00:45:29,400 --> 00:45:30,819
She most likely took

823
00:45:30,861 --> 00:45:32,691
some dangerous medicine
to end her pregnancy.

824
00:45:32,960 --> 00:45:33,710
Right now,

825
00:45:34,070 --> 00:45:35,000
her condition is critical.

826
00:45:37,040 --> 00:45:40,333
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

827
00:45:43,018 --> 00:45:47,934
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

828
00:45:50,128 --> 00:45:55,973
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

829
00:45:56,473 --> 00:46:01,699
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

830
00:46:04,468 --> 00:46:09,259
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

831
00:46:10,095 --> 00:46:16,174
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

832
00:46:17,975 --> 00:46:21,125
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

833
00:46:21,125 --> 00:46:22,773
♪Burning bright as a song♪

834
00:46:22,825 --> 00:46:26,549
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

835
00:46:26,927 --> 00:46:31,593
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

836
00:46:32,212 --> 00:46:36,253
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

837
00:46:36,744 --> 00:46:38,859
♪Not a single hour less♪

838
00:46:38,899 --> 00:46:45,845
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

839
00:46:46,608 --> 00:46:50,061
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

840
00:46:50,241 --> 00:46:53,386
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

841
00:46:53,825 --> 00:47:00,462
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

842
00:47:00,859 --> 00:47:02,897
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

843
00:47:02,897 --> 00:47:05,373
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

844
00:47:05,411 --> 00:47:07,880
♪You're the only one I need♪

845
00:47:08,084 --> 00:47:14,971
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

846
00:47:15,283 --> 00:47:18,554
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

847
00:47:18,859 --> 00:47:22,032
♪My last untouched innocence♪

848
00:47:22,356 --> 00:47:25,782
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

849
00:47:26,015 --> 00:47:29,240
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

850
00:47:29,571 --> 00:47:36,367
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

851
00:47:36,736 --> 00:47:38,798
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

852
00:47:38,799 --> 00:47:41,302
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

853
00:47:41,349 --> 00:47:43,687
♪You're the only one I need♪

854
00:47:43,918 --> 00:47:50,753
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

855
00:47:51,102 --> 00:47:52,720
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

856
00:47:52,850 --> 00:47:54,646
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

857
00:47:55,003 --> 00:47:58,020
♪You're the only one I need♪

858
00:47:58,060 --> 00:47:59,387
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)

